Cell["\<\
samples must be a nonempty list of real scalar values or lists containing \
only Real expressions. Convert exact integer grids with N before calling.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->104403632,ExpressionUUID->"b5383ca0-f3c9-254a-9b99-6c296f52437f"],

Cell["\<\
At each sample, the full eigenvalue list is sorted and the difference \
E[n+1]-E[n] is taken. The smallest sampled difference is returned after Chop.\
\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->979428900,ExpressionUUID->"1ad894be-a05f-284b-b21a-1f82940e472d"],

Cell["\<\
n must lie between 1 and matrixDimension-1. This is a sampled estimate, not a \
continuous minimization over the Brillouin zone.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->646697945,ExpressionUUID->"5f5ace2b-c6ba-5949-8b5b-12633d6c8257"],

Cell["\<\
Eigenvalues options are accepted and Method -> \"Direct\" is supplied \
internally.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1004595424,ExpressionUUID->"54cca771-1a3e-e64f-902f-08b507f03f42"]
}, Closed]],

